WEBVTT

01:28.530 --> 01:32.410
Our Secret
EP06

01:41.720 --> 01:42.160
I'm ready.

01:45.610 --> 01:46.760
Come on, Ding Xian.

01:56.080 --> 01:57.010
How many have I done, bro?

01:59.440 --> 02:00.480
Come on, Ding Xian.

02:02.570 --> 02:03.890
Are you counting?

02:12.000 --> 02:13.250
You are free

02:13.250 --> 02:14.560
after the physical fitness test.

02:20.920 --> 02:21.719
Come on, let's play in groups.

02:21.719 --> 02:22.610
In groups.

02:25.490 --> 02:26.690
Okay, I'm the first.

02:27.520 --> 02:28.360
Pass it to me.

02:30.800 --> 02:32.000
Are you tired, Ding Xian?

02:32.000 --> 02:33.330
Not at all. I'm OK.

02:36.050 --> 02:36.850
I quit.

02:38.050 --> 02:38.770
Why?

02:39.690 --> 02:40.560
You don't play?

02:40.719 --> 02:41.969
Oh, let him go. Game starts.

02:41.969 --> 02:43.000
Come on,

02:43.640 --> 02:44.250
pass the ball to me.

02:47.440 --> 02:49.250
The last thing before you leaving.

02:49.490 --> 02:50.250
The sports meeting

02:50.490 --> 02:52.640
is coming next month.

02:53.050 --> 02:55.410
In usual, you have many complaints

02:55.610 --> 02:56.280
when the PE class

02:56.610 --> 02:57.969
is occupied by other subjects.

02:58.440 --> 03:00.210
Now it's the time to

03:00.360 --> 03:02.280
release your passion for it.

03:02.770 --> 03:04.210
Don't worry,

03:04.690 --> 03:05.770
only one requirement.

03:05.920 --> 03:07.770
I want to see my students

03:08.000 --> 03:08.970
in every event.

03:09.440 --> 03:11.080
It's better for you to have good performance.

03:11.640 --> 03:13.050
Song Ziqi, you are in charge of sports activities.

03:13.720 --> 03:16.440
Collect the signing up results

03:16.720 --> 03:18.280
and put the entry form on my desk.

03:18.440 --> 03:19.330
Yes, sir.

03:19.490 --> 03:20.330
Classes are over.

03:23.210 --> 03:24.080
Hey, you can

03:24.640 --> 03:26.250
compete in the shot put.

03:28.560 --> 03:30.280
Song Ziqi, are you crazy?

03:30.440 --> 03:31.690
Hey, it's rude.

03:32.130 --> 03:33.920
I'm serious. I reckon that you can do it.

03:34.130 --> 03:35.690
Your punch is so hard.

03:35.850 --> 03:37.410
You may win a prize.

03:38.520 --> 03:39.850
Think it over.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.050
Little Monster

03:49.410 --> 03:50.330
Forget it.

03:50.520 --> 03:51.610
You are too thin

03:51.850 --> 03:53.280
to compete in the sports meeting.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.560
Siyue

03:55.770 --> 03:56.969
Do you wanna join the long-distance running?

03:57.560 --> 03:58.719
Do it as you see fit.

03:58.920 --> 04:00.250
Okay, it's up to me.

04:00.440 --> 04:02.850
Short-distance running, shot put,

04:03.130 --> 04:05.050
high jump and long jump... oh you are so busy.

04:09.410 --> 04:11.330
Can you tell me, except this game,

04:11.330 --> 04:12.690
do we have other entertainments?

04:12.690 --> 04:13.440
What do you like?

04:14.000 --> 04:15.210
Um, like basketball

04:15.210 --> 04:15.690
or billiards.

04:15.690 --> 04:17.090
You've promised to me that

04:17.090 --> 04:18.210
you would concede me points.

04:18.210 --> 04:19.330
When will you do it?

04:20.000 --> 04:20.930
Answer me.

04:26.400 --> 04:27.960
Ding Xian, do you remember me?

04:28.530 --> 04:29.680
You Keke

04:30.370 --> 04:31.490
One thing to give you.

04:35.330 --> 04:36.090
Please help me

04:36.160 --> 04:37.530
to give it to Zhou Siyue tomorrow.

04:38.000 --> 04:40.210
-I, or you... -It took me

04:40.370 --> 04:41.440
one morning to finish it.

04:41.610 --> 04:42.560
Just be careful.

04:42.770 --> 04:43.610
Thank you.

04:47.560 --> 04:49.160
Why should I do that again?

06:38.120 --> 06:39.160
It's for you.

06:40.770 --> 06:42.720
Thank you, but I'm good.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.960
I read your letter.

06:53.560 --> 06:54.720
I've forgiven you.

06:59.280 --> 06:59.960
Well,

07:00.210 --> 07:01.890
that's not my letter.

07:02.240 --> 07:03.650
Don't defend it.

07:05.090 --> 07:08.840
It's from You Keke, a girl in Class Ten.

07:29.720 --> 07:30.530
And what's this?

07:33.560 --> 07:34.490
This is...

07:42.210 --> 07:43.280
Come outside with me.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.160
The class is beginning.

07:45.370 --> 07:46.160
Come out.

08:04.120 --> 08:05.890
Delivered the letter. Now the gift.

08:07.090 --> 08:08.210
Are you a courier?

08:09.930 --> 08:11.720
I'm just helping her.

08:12.000 --> 08:13.280
Why don't you refuse?

08:25.720 --> 08:26.810
I apologize.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.770
It's my fault.

08:29.090 --> 08:31.240
I won't ask you to do my mission anymore.

08:32.000 --> 08:33.600
I'm not so mean.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.920
So why are you unhappy?

08:38.040 --> 08:39.330
You are close to Liu Xiaofeng

08:39.530 --> 08:40.650
and never mind others' comments.

08:41.330 --> 08:43.090
We all are schoolmates. Anything different?

08:48.120 --> 08:49.090
Tell me.

08:58.170 --> 08:59.090
Ding Xian

08:59.440 --> 09:00.240
Can you tell me

09:00.440 --> 09:02.000
what you are thinking?

09:02.360 --> 09:03.120
Or you just reckon that

09:03.290 --> 09:05.000
it's interesting that we were not on speaking terms?

09:05.170 --> 09:06.090
I don't see it that way.

09:07.290 --> 09:08.290
Just tell me please,

09:10.680 --> 09:12.000
what's your worry?

09:24.480 --> 09:25.650
Don't put these rubbish

09:25.650 --> 09:27.650
into my desk.

10:45.090 --> 10:47.450
The playground is bathed in the warm sunshine.

10:47.930 --> 10:51.010
The male Group B of high jump of Grade Two will begin.

10:51.600 --> 10:54.040
On the playground, athletes' robust posture

10:54.290 --> 10:56.120
shot across the sky.

10:56.530 --> 10:57.970
The ocean is mighty

10:58.290 --> 10:59.770
and the drumming is splendid.

11:00.090 --> 11:00.970
Dear athletes,

11:01.290 --> 11:03.480
you're mighty as the ocean today.

11:03.800 --> 11:05.170
We will cheer for you.

11:05.210 --> 11:06.360
What are you doing?

11:07.650 --> 11:08.800
I'm writing the composition.

11:09.560 --> 11:10.920
That's not my point.

11:13.330 --> 11:14.850
Is your deskmate in any race?

11:15.890 --> 11:16.890
Yes.

11:17.210 --> 11:19.970
Now male long-distance running of Grade One will begin.

11:20.330 --> 11:21.560
All participants please gather at the starting line.

11:21.560 --> 11:22.530
Zhou Siyue, our race will begin.

11:23.600 --> 11:24.480
Okay.

11:31.530 --> 11:32.240
Wait a minute.

11:32.410 --> 11:33.600
I should check the composition for me.

11:33.800 --> 11:34.850
Just a minute.

11:37.560 --> 11:39.330
Ding Xian, have you finished it?

11:39.480 --> 11:40.290
My race will begin.

11:40.440 --> 11:42.290
Almost done. I'll hand it in.

11:42.920 --> 11:44.440
It's for me, isn't it?

11:46.290 --> 11:47.770
I have to go, see ya.

11:48.890 --> 11:49.680
Let's go.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.600
I found him

11:53.040 --> 11:54.290
was special to you.

11:54.650 --> 11:55.730
You are kidding me.

11:58.890 --> 12:00.290
I'm handing in the composition.

12:02.770 --> 12:04.560
Though athletes running on the playground

12:04.800 --> 12:06.440
can't receive flowers,

12:06.730 --> 12:08.600
you'll embrace the rainbow after rains.

12:08.920 --> 12:10.090
Athletes from Class Three,

12:10.240 --> 12:12.210
we feel proud of you.

12:12.330 --> 12:13.680
Liu Xiaofeng, you can make it!

12:13.680 --> 12:14.730
Come on, Class Three!

12:14.890 --> 12:16.440
Come on, Class Three!

12:16.600 --> 12:18.170
Come on, Class Three!

12:18.290 --> 12:19.890
Come on, Class Three!

12:20.090 --> 12:21.560
Come on, Class Three!

12:21.850 --> 12:22.800
That's your work?

12:25.730 --> 12:27.210
Much better than my letter.

12:27.650 --> 12:28.730
You can be my ghost writer next time.

12:30.850 --> 12:32.770
Sorry, your letter...

12:38.090 --> 12:39.920
What did you say just now?

12:39.920 --> 12:40.770
What's wrong?

12:42.290 --> 12:42.730
Your letter...

12:42.730 --> 12:44.890
You didn't give it to him?

12:45.120 --> 12:46.240
I did give it to him.

12:46.770 --> 12:48.770
Just a joke. Take it easy.

12:49.000 --> 12:49.970
What's wrong?

12:52.240 --> 12:54.210
I tore it by accident

12:54.650 --> 12:56.560
but I made a transcript.

12:56.770 --> 12:58.730
You've read my letter to Zhou Siyue.

13:02.210 --> 13:03.210
How about it?

13:06.360 --> 13:07.410
Oh, don't worry.

13:07.600 --> 13:09.170
I didn't write it by myself.

13:13.560 --> 13:14.920
I know you don't care

13:16.090 --> 13:17.240
but I should apologize.

13:17.850 --> 13:19.800
It was an accident.

13:22.120 --> 13:23.680
If you feel sorry,

13:24.240 --> 13:25.770
you can do me another favour.

13:26.480 --> 13:27.530
What's it?

13:27.850 --> 13:28.970
Come on, Class Three!

13:32.770 --> 13:33.770
Shadi, look at this.

13:33.770 --> 13:34.800
I bought it, too.

13:34.890 --> 13:36.290
Now we have the same earphone,

13:37.170 --> 13:39.210
but its quality seems to be worse

13:39.410 --> 13:41.360
than my old one.

13:41.560 --> 13:42.090
I want to

13:42.240 --> 13:44.000
have lunch with you every day.

13:44.850 --> 13:46.040
Have lunch with me?

13:46.560 --> 13:47.560
Yep.

13:48.240 --> 13:51.770
Why not eat with girls in your class?

13:52.560 --> 13:54.730
I don't like being with them.

13:55.850 --> 13:57.480
Okay, it's a deal.

13:57.650 --> 13:59.560
We are lunch pals.

13:59.680 --> 14:00.040
See you.

14:00.040 --> 14:00.530
I...

14:05.240 --> 14:06.560
The male long-distance running

14:06.560 --> 14:07.920
is coming to the end.

14:08.210 --> 14:09.800
With perseverance,

14:10.040 --> 14:11.770
athletes are approaching the end now.

14:12.040 --> 14:15.040
Let's cheer them on!

14:15.530 --> 14:17.120
Come on! Come on!

14:17.330 --> 14:18.920
Come on! Come on!

14:23.800 --> 14:25.240
Here you are. Good job.

14:36.800 --> 14:38.170
It's for me?

14:55.850 --> 14:56.770
I knew it.

15:18.480 --> 15:20.480
The final exam of this year is coming.

15:21.480 --> 15:22.680
I haven't sent

15:22.680 --> 15:24.600
the picture I drew for Zhou Siyue

15:24.600 --> 15:25.440
to him.

15:27.040 --> 15:29.090
And I haven't been reconciled with Kong Shadi.

15:30.970 --> 15:32.040
I don't know

15:32.040 --> 15:34.000
how to say no to You Keke.

15:35.770 --> 15:37.240
I may admit

15:38.560 --> 15:40.440
that I'm just a timid girl

15:41.440 --> 15:43.480
who can't say no.

15:57.240 --> 15:59.530
The final exam of your first year

15:59.890 --> 16:01.090
is very important.

16:01.850 --> 16:02.970
It's linked to

16:03.120 --> 16:05.800
your class dividing in Grade Two, arts or sciences.

16:06.090 --> 16:08.240
If you've made up your mind,

16:08.440 --> 16:10.040
you should be well prepared.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.440
If you have no idea,

16:11.680 --> 16:13.970
this exam is a chance

16:14.170 --> 16:15.120
to examine yourself.

16:15.330 --> 16:16.170
Which one do you like?

16:16.600 --> 16:17.730
Which one is suitable?

16:17.970 --> 16:20.290
At last, I wish you have good performance!

16:20.530 --> 16:21.170
Come on!

16:21.730 --> 16:22.440
You can make it!

16:23.040 --> 16:23.970
Make it!

16:24.210 --> 16:25.040
Make it!

16:59.560 --> 17:00.090
Why did you hit me?

17:00.090 --> 17:01.090
Can you be girlish?

17:02.090 --> 17:03.000
Oh you deserve it.

17:05.770 --> 17:06.840
Any question?

17:07.959 --> 17:08.999
I have to go, bye.

17:14.320 --> 17:15.959
How is it going with your robot contest in the summer holiday?

17:16.200 --> 17:17.050
Got a prize?

17:17.450 --> 17:18.479
Have a guess.

17:19.890 --> 17:21.320
Well done.

17:21.810 --> 17:23.650
You could go to the Huaqing University with so many prizes.

17:25.080 --> 17:27.200
It's not as easy as you thought.

17:27.450 --> 17:29.770
And you'll have the birthday party tonight.

17:29.960 --> 17:31.690
Good things come in pairs.

17:32.320 --> 17:33.360
Good.

17:37.240 --> 17:38.240
That's Little Monster.

17:38.890 --> 17:39.840
Did you ask her to join us?

17:55.240 --> 17:57.000
Sister, I don't want to stay here.

17:57.000 --> 17:58.170
It's so boring.

17:58.840 --> 18:00.120
I'm going there.

18:01.930 --> 18:02.930
Okay.

18:05.170 --> 18:06.840
Why are you guys so weird?

18:07.050 --> 18:08.480
It really bothers me.

18:09.840 --> 18:11.480
The thing between she and she is not the one

18:11.570 --> 18:12.600
between she and me.

18:14.690 --> 18:15.960
Is that a tongue twister?

18:16.120 --> 18:17.050
I can't get it.

18:17.240 --> 18:19.840
I only knew you made me embarrassed.

18:20.720 --> 18:22.410
Girls are difficult to understand.

18:22.570 --> 18:23.930
Don't like us, simple and innocent.

18:26.290 --> 18:28.530
You're innocent, not me.

18:31.320 --> 18:32.170
Let me go!

18:33.320 --> 18:34.410
Really fierce, boy.

18:34.410 --> 18:35.240
Let me go!

18:35.960 --> 18:37.890
You two, leave me alone.

18:40.450 --> 18:41.200
Hey, hurry up

18:41.240 --> 18:42.120
or she'll go.

18:42.360 --> 18:43.770
Come on, she's gone.

18:47.570 --> 18:48.530
Piss off!

18:49.080 --> 18:50.050
What are you doing?

18:50.050 --> 18:50.810
Piss off!

18:51.600 --> 18:52.000
Get away!

18:52.000 --> 18:53.360
Stand here! I'll pummel you!

18:58.000 --> 18:59.050
Are you OK?

18:59.600 --> 19:00.650
It's none of your business.

19:03.360 --> 19:04.320
Okay, come back home.

19:05.450 --> 19:06.360
Don't run around anymore.

19:13.770 --> 19:14.770
Hurry up.

19:32.290 --> 19:33.480
Be rebellious at home

19:33.890 --> 19:35.320
and be bullied outside.

19:36.200 --> 19:37.720
Why not fight against them?

19:38.080 --> 19:39.000
It's not your business.

19:39.690 --> 19:40.650
Not my business.

19:41.050 --> 19:43.650
I'm your sister, so it's my business.

19:44.410 --> 19:45.290
Keep still.

19:46.720 --> 19:47.810
Now it hurts?

19:48.450 --> 19:49.840
Two-faced, are you?

19:50.000 --> 19:50.810
Oh, stop it.

19:50.930 --> 19:52.050
You're the same as me.

19:52.450 --> 19:53.480
Be fierce in front of me

19:53.650 --> 19:55.570
and be a lady in school.

19:59.450 --> 20:00.690
Ding Juncong

20:07.570 --> 20:09.410
It looks delicious!

20:10.480 --> 20:12.690
Shall we begin now?

20:13.600 --> 20:14.450
Wait a minute.

20:14.600 --> 20:15.320
Be patient.

21:11.450 --> 21:12.770
How long are we going to have to wait?

21:13.890 --> 21:15.050
Don't complain.

21:15.530 --> 21:16.050
Why not?

21:18.360 --> 21:19.000
Okay.

21:20.360 --> 21:21.690
Let's start, guys.

22:42.320 --> 22:43.080
Here you come.

22:52.050 --> 22:53.050
Sorry,

22:53.840 --> 22:55.080
I'm late.

22:57.530 --> 22:58.720
Where are the others?

23:00.320 --> 23:02.240
They went to the Karaoke.

23:03.240 --> 23:04.840
Why are you here?

23:05.360 --> 23:06.960
I've had enough of the regular activities.

23:07.450 --> 23:08.290
A bit boring.

23:13.450 --> 23:14.480
I'm sorry.

23:15.960 --> 23:17.050
For what?

23:19.770 --> 23:20.810
For your

23:21.650 --> 23:22.960
having quarrel with me?

23:23.240 --> 23:25.000
Or for the absence of my birthday party?

23:28.200 --> 23:29.480
Both of them.

23:31.930 --> 23:32.890
Okay,

23:33.600 --> 23:34.690
I've forgiven you,

23:35.530 --> 23:37.930
but how can you compensate me?

23:41.690 --> 23:42.570
Well,

23:43.650 --> 23:44.890
I'll come to your next birthday party,

23:45.080 --> 23:46.450
I promise.

23:47.360 --> 23:48.530
Why should it be the next one?

23:49.450 --> 23:50.890
It's still my birthday now.

24:07.050 --> 24:07.890
Zhou Siyue

24:08.960 --> 24:10.890
Happy birthday to you.

24:13.690 --> 24:14.530
Thank you.

24:15.320 --> 24:16.450
It's for you.

24:18.720 --> 24:20.050
My gift?

24:23.840 --> 24:24.810
Let me see.

24:32.960 --> 24:34.650
It's the nebula picture on your birthday.

24:40.240 --> 24:41.240
It's beautiful.

24:42.080 --> 24:42.930
Good.

24:43.120 --> 24:44.050
I like it.

24:45.650 --> 24:46.840
I'm glad you like it.

24:49.050 --> 24:49.960
Thank you.

24:54.170 --> 24:55.480
Blow out the candle.

25:02.360 --> 25:05.480
I hope your birthday wish will come true.

25:06.890 --> 25:07.890
It came true.

25:08.690 --> 25:10.320
What's your wish?

25:12.650 --> 25:13.890
It's my secret.

25:15.650 --> 25:16.480
Here,

25:17.360 --> 25:19.240
I have a gift for you, too.

25:24.360 --> 25:25.890
Oh, it's too expensive.

25:26.050 --> 25:27.050
I can't take it.

25:27.200 --> 25:28.530
It's not so expensive.

25:28.720 --> 25:29.840
It's free.

25:30.890 --> 25:32.000
Free?

25:32.810 --> 25:34.840
I participated in a contest days ago.

25:35.170 --> 25:36.650
That's my prize.

25:37.770 --> 25:39.290
I can't take this.

25:39.570 --> 25:40.770
Or you sell me the picture,

25:41.080 --> 25:43.000
and this is paid for it.

25:43.450 --> 25:45.290
My picture is valueless.

25:45.530 --> 25:46.840
I don't think so.

25:50.480 --> 25:52.600
It may appreciate someday.

25:54.480 --> 25:55.480
Okay,

25:55.890 --> 25:56.840
Take it easy.

25:57.360 --> 25:58.810
Now I lend it to you,

25:59.120 --> 26:01.570
you can return it when you get a new one.

26:03.170 --> 26:05.240
I don't want to lose contact with you anymore.

26:28.960 --> 26:29.930
Hello?

26:31.080 --> 26:32.570
Hey, Ding Xian.

26:32.570 --> 26:34.480
I... pressed the wrong button.

26:43.080 --> 26:44.890
Silly girl.

27:10.050 --> 27:11.360
Xianxian, you should get up.

27:13.290 --> 27:14.170
Dad

27:14.690 --> 27:17.050
It's holiday. Let me sleep in.

27:18.530 --> 27:19.840
Wake up, my girl.

27:20.120 --> 27:21.410
Your holiday was over.

27:21.570 --> 27:22.960
Today you should go to school.

27:25.360 --> 27:26.570
Hurry up. The meal is on the table.

27:26.890 --> 27:28.000
I'm going to work.

27:29.770 --> 27:30.650
What's the sound?

27:35.720 --> 27:36.770
Alarm clock, dad.

27:36.930 --> 27:38.200
I'm changing clothes.

27:39.120 --> 27:40.120
Okay, don't be late.

27:52.050 --> 27:54.690
Go to school together. I'm downstairs.

28:03.960 --> 28:04.650
Good morning.

28:05.570 --> 28:06.530
We would skip the morning self-study course

28:06.690 --> 28:07.960
if you were later.

28:08.530 --> 28:10.120
Sorry, I overslept.

28:13.410 --> 28:15.450
Did you forget that it's a school day?

28:18.240 --> 28:21.530
Just feel that the summer hasn't finished.

28:23.080 --> 28:23.960
It's silly.

28:24.240 --> 28:25.120
It's our second year.

28:25.360 --> 28:26.960
The division of arts and sciences is coming.

28:30.000 --> 28:33.200
Why are there so many choices in our life?

28:36.410 --> 28:37.290
Hurry up

28:37.480 --> 28:39.200
or we'll be late.

28:39.690 --> 28:40.770
My hair...

28:48.450 --> 28:51.050
Siyue, can I copy your math homework?

28:51.480 --> 28:52.200
Ding Xian

28:53.170 --> 28:54.360
Give him yours.

28:57.360 --> 28:58.290
You are reconciled.

28:59.770 --> 29:00.770
I've said that

29:01.000 --> 29:03.200
we had to maintain the friendship with deskmates.

29:03.410 --> 29:04.200
-Or you... -Song Ziqi

29:04.410 --> 29:05.480
Take your breakfast or I'll dump it.

29:06.170 --> 29:07.240
I'm here, madam. Don't dump it.

29:10.930 --> 29:12.410
Why is she mad at you?

29:12.840 --> 29:14.720
Because of the letter.

29:14.840 --> 29:16.410
How dare you mention it?

29:17.050 --> 29:18.530
It's an accident.

29:19.810 --> 29:21.600
It's so typical of you.

29:24.480 --> 29:25.690
I'm sorry.

29:26.000 --> 29:27.770
I promise it won't happen again.

29:32.360 --> 29:34.570
What's the probability that

29:34.930 --> 29:36.720
the times you get red balls

29:36.930 --> 29:38.530
is more than the times

29:38.530 --> 29:40.120
you get the white ones?

29:41.080 --> 29:42.320
What's the probability?

29:42.960 --> 29:45.720
You have to apply this formula.

29:46.200 --> 29:47.120
Okay, keep sleeping.

29:48.050 --> 29:49.200
No one cares.

29:52.080 --> 29:53.480
We'll continue when all of you

29:53.480 --> 29:54.890
wake up.

29:55.890 --> 29:58.720
Why do you know the knowledge of Grade Two?

29:59.170 --> 30:01.080
I've seen it in a Mathematical Olympiad problem.

30:01.360 --> 30:02.890
So I learned it in advance.

30:05.690 --> 30:07.600
Wake up, guys!

30:08.200 --> 30:10.930
The exam of class dividing is coming.

30:11.120 --> 30:12.960
You are in the second year now.

30:13.120 --> 30:15.120
It's as important as the last year.

30:15.290 --> 30:16.810
Do you understand?

30:17.690 --> 30:18.570
Song Ziqi

30:19.050 --> 30:20.290
Stand up!

30:21.120 --> 30:23.000
If you are still sleepy,

30:23.170 --> 30:24.840
you can stand up.

30:26.450 --> 30:28.000
What are you thinking?

30:28.170 --> 30:30.200
Don't like taking lessons?

30:30.810 --> 30:32.600
These are extra lessons

30:32.770 --> 30:34.530
but not teachers' compulsory obligation.

30:34.690 --> 30:36.200
We want to help you

30:36.290 --> 30:37.650
finish the courses of high school sooner,

30:37.840 --> 30:38.840
so in the last year

30:39.000 --> 30:40.930
you can have enough time to revise.

30:41.480 --> 30:42.650
What do you think

30:42.840 --> 30:44.480
why I don't take the summer holiday

30:44.690 --> 30:46.240
but stand here to give your extra lessons.

30:46.240 --> 30:47.600
Am I crazy?

30:55.120 --> 30:56.840
Well, next class is Physics.

30:57.890 --> 30:59.120
Wake up, guys.

30:59.290 --> 31:01.240
Wash your face if you feel drowsy.

31:01.600 --> 31:02.200
Okay?

31:02.200 --> 31:03.480
Okay.

31:04.770 --> 31:05.480
Um,

31:05.890 --> 31:06.650
Deng Wanwan,

31:06.840 --> 31:07.930
remember to hand out the

31:08.120 --> 31:09.360
application forms of the class dividing.

31:09.570 --> 31:10.320
Yes, sir.

31:10.480 --> 31:11.570
Take this period

31:11.720 --> 31:13.840
to think it over.

31:14.840 --> 31:16.480
Give me before this Friday.

31:17.080 --> 31:18.000
Zhou Siyue

31:18.320 --> 31:19.290
Come here.

31:29.450 --> 31:30.290
Shadi

31:30.450 --> 31:31.290
Wanwan

31:31.360 --> 31:32.080
I want to drink water, too.

31:32.240 --> 31:32.930
Let's go together.

31:32.930 --> 31:33.450
Okay.

31:38.120 --> 31:38.930
Little Monster

31:39.080 --> 31:39.890
Don't mind.

31:40.050 --> 31:41.200
That's how she usually is.

31:42.240 --> 31:43.170
Can you help me hand out the homework?

31:43.320 --> 31:44.320
Nature calls.

31:44.480 --> 31:45.200
Thank you.

31:53.690 --> 31:55.240
I've put your name down on the list

31:55.450 --> 31:57.120
of participants of the municipal math competition.

31:57.480 --> 31:59.320
I'll give you some exam papers in a few days.

31:59.570 --> 32:01.320
You should prepare for it.

32:01.600 --> 32:03.120
If you can win a prize this time,

32:03.360 --> 32:05.320
you can take the national college entrance exam next year.

32:06.930 --> 32:07.930
Thank you, sir.

32:08.080 --> 32:10.840
Though you've taken municipal contests at junior high school,

32:11.080 --> 32:13.360
the contests of high school is more difficult.

32:13.650 --> 32:15.770
All in all, you can make your schedule now.

32:17.690 --> 32:18.600
Okay, sir.

32:19.480 --> 32:20.840
I trust you.

32:26.720 --> 32:27.650
Come on.

32:50.080 --> 32:51.050
You're done.

32:52.320 --> 32:54.360
It's Shadi's favorite diary.

33:01.650 --> 33:02.720
Sorry, Shadi.

33:02.930 --> 33:04.450
It's an accident.

33:25.240 --> 33:26.320
Why are you here?

33:30.320 --> 33:31.650
I didn't mean to.

33:31.810 --> 33:33.600
I can buy you a new one.

33:34.290 --> 33:35.450
How can you get it?

33:35.810 --> 33:38.050
It's bought by my dad in Japan.

33:39.930 --> 33:41.240
I'll figure it out.

33:41.890 --> 33:42.690
How?

33:43.170 --> 33:44.530
Buy a same one

33:45.290 --> 33:46.960
and transcribe the content

33:47.200 --> 33:49.240
like you do to You Keke's letter?

33:49.290 --> 33:50.450
What do you mean?

33:50.650 --> 33:52.690
That's typical of you, Ding Xian.

33:53.080 --> 33:55.000
I've had enough, Kong Shadi.

34:14.080 --> 34:15.690
Sorry, Shadi.

34:15.890 --> 34:17.040
Don't cry.

34:17.410 --> 34:18.450
Leave me alone.

34:18.600 --> 34:19.410
Don't bother me.

34:19.560 --> 34:20.650
How dare you.

34:22.520 --> 34:25.040
I didn't mean it that day.

34:25.799 --> 34:27.010
I'm so sorry.

34:27.170 --> 34:28.450
Don't cry.

34:28.690 --> 34:29.730
Forgive me.

34:32.319 --> 34:33.970
Stop crying

34:34.120 --> 34:36.279
or I want to cry, too.

34:36.490 --> 34:38.930
You are heartless.

34:39.730 --> 34:42.359
You're right.

34:44.650 --> 34:46.410
Why don't you go to You Keke?

34:46.600 --> 34:47.490
She's your friend.

34:47.650 --> 34:49.250
Why did you come to me?

34:49.690 --> 34:51.839
You are my friend, too.

34:56.359 --> 34:58.120
Listen, Shadi.

34:58.840 --> 35:00.560
Because of the letter

35:01.600 --> 35:04.410
I've made such a mess of my life.

35:05.120 --> 35:06.450
You are mad at me,

35:07.250 --> 35:09.490
so is Zhou Siyue.

35:10.930 --> 35:12.360
It reminds me

35:12.600 --> 35:13.490
of my early days

35:13.760 --> 35:16.040
in this high school.

35:17.360 --> 35:19.010
And I realized that

35:19.410 --> 35:20.970
I was a yea and nay

35:21.250 --> 35:22.320
coward.

35:22.930 --> 35:25.840
You are so brave and confident.

35:26.450 --> 35:27.120
That's why

35:27.320 --> 35:29.560
I really like being friends with you.

35:30.040 --> 35:32.410
Can you forgive me? Please.

35:39.360 --> 35:41.080
It's stinking.

35:41.890 --> 35:43.760
It's ugly.

35:45.040 --> 35:45.930
Okay,

35:46.170 --> 35:47.320
let's go.

35:49.210 --> 35:50.450
Don't cry.

35:52.890 --> 35:54.320
You're so ugly after crying.

35:54.560 --> 35:55.490
You're ugly.

35:56.800 --> 35:59.120
Let's have lunch together.

36:00.320 --> 36:01.690
Have something good.

36:04.760 --> 36:05.560
You two

36:05.730 --> 36:06.490
are reconciled?

36:07.210 --> 36:08.520
Oh you shut up.

36:10.010 --> 36:11.170
You are reconciled.

36:13.650 --> 36:15.210
It took a long time to beg her pardon.

36:16.840 --> 36:18.520
You know how to beg one's pardon.

36:19.080 --> 36:20.080
Good job.

36:23.410 --> 36:25.120
You can beg her pardon

36:25.760 --> 36:27.650
but refuse to coax me.

36:29.360 --> 36:31.280
I've spoiled you.

36:33.450 --> 36:35.120
It's different.

36:35.520 --> 36:36.690
What's the difference?

36:50.010 --> 36:51.890
I want the same treatment

36:52.210 --> 36:54.010
if we have a quarrel next time.

36:56.450 --> 36:57.760
Okay.

37:04.490 --> 37:05.210
Hey.

37:09.730 --> 37:10.360
Siyue

37:10.560 --> 37:12.080
Have you handed in the application form?

37:14.490 --> 37:15.170
Not yet.

37:15.650 --> 37:16.450
No need to be hurried.

37:17.560 --> 37:18.600
You've handed it in?

37:19.930 --> 37:21.730
There's no need to hesitate

37:21.890 --> 37:23.490
since I'm sure to learn sciences.

37:23.690 --> 37:24.840
You chose sciences.

37:25.010 --> 37:25.730
Of course.

37:25.930 --> 37:27.210
Do you think I can learn arts?

37:28.650 --> 37:29.490
I'll choose sciences, too.

37:31.120 --> 37:32.280
Are you serious?

37:32.650 --> 37:34.170
You wanna follow me?

37:34.170 --> 37:35.320
Stop being narcissistic.

37:35.600 --> 37:36.800
What if Yang Chunzi and I

37:37.010 --> 37:38.650
enter the same class if I learn arts?

37:38.650 --> 37:39.560
I can't stand that.

37:40.040 --> 37:40.560
Right,

37:40.650 --> 37:43.280
I think girls will prefer liberal arts.

37:43.450 --> 37:45.450
Yang Chunzi is too far-sighted

37:45.650 --> 37:47.040
to choose the liberal arts. It's easier.

37:48.690 --> 37:50.170
If you learn sciences,

37:51.410 --> 37:53.280
you'll be apart with Little Monster.

37:54.410 --> 37:56.040
Xianxian, will you learn arts?

37:56.490 --> 37:57.170
If you choose arts,

37:57.210 --> 37:58.760
we can't see each other in class.

38:00.120 --> 38:01.250
It's sad.

38:02.600 --> 38:04.040
I'm not sure.

38:04.040 --> 38:05.490
I may choose arts.

38:06.490 --> 38:07.120
Really?

38:08.450 --> 38:09.650
Then Zhou Siyue

38:09.650 --> 38:10.730
can continue to be your tutor.

38:12.520 --> 38:13.490
Trust me,

38:13.600 --> 38:14.800
I can depend on myself.

38:14.800 --> 38:15.650
I won't trouble him.

38:19.730 --> 38:20.930
I knew you would forget.

38:22.320 --> 38:23.320
Keke

38:23.520 --> 38:24.450
Why are you here?

38:24.600 --> 38:26.890
Ding Xian's promised me to have lunch together.

38:29.970 --> 38:30.890
I'm sorry.

38:32.170 --> 38:33.210
Or you

38:33.730 --> 38:35.410
eat with us.

38:38.210 --> 38:38.840
Um,

38:39.170 --> 38:40.010
who can introduce

38:40.210 --> 38:41.490
this lady...

38:42.080 --> 38:42.970
Why did you step on my foot?

38:43.560 --> 38:44.280
Again?

38:44.410 --> 38:45.280
Are you insane, Kong Shadi?

38:45.320 --> 38:46.930
You are insane. Eat your food.

38:46.930 --> 38:47.890
Hello, Zhou Siyue.

38:48.170 --> 38:49.250
Nice to see you.

38:50.840 --> 38:51.890
I'm from Class Ten,

38:52.120 --> 38:53.120
the girl who sent you the letter.

38:59.490 --> 39:00.170
I know you.

39:01.890 --> 39:02.970
Take it easy.

39:03.250 --> 39:04.560
I did send you the letter,

39:04.890 --> 39:06.930
but I won't pester you.

39:07.690 --> 39:08.760
Your deskmate

39:09.010 --> 39:10.280
is more interesting than you.

39:11.520 --> 39:12.970
Little Monster now is

39:12.970 --> 39:14.080
popular with others.

39:14.840 --> 39:16.360
Can you stop it?

39:16.360 --> 39:17.410
Just focus on your food.

39:19.930 --> 39:20.650
I've had enough.

39:20.890 --> 39:21.560
Help yourself.

39:26.120 --> 39:27.520
You are annoying.

39:27.730 --> 39:28.690
Why are you always around us?

39:29.040 --> 39:30.930
I'm here for Ding Xian, not you.

39:31.280 --> 39:33.520
Just leave here if you don't like me.

39:33.650 --> 39:34.360
Why should I leave?

39:34.360 --> 39:35.360
Why don't you leave?

39:36.970 --> 39:37.690
Kong Shadi

39:38.210 --> 39:39.410
Do you hate me

39:40.010 --> 39:40.930
just because

39:40.970 --> 39:42.040
I'm more beautiful than you?

39:42.360 --> 39:43.490
Scared of feeling small?

39:44.210 --> 39:45.250
Are you kidding?

39:45.490 --> 39:47.120
Don't pester us anymore.

39:47.360 --> 39:48.170
Oh, no way.

39:48.250 --> 39:50.320
I'll keep pester you and Zhou Siyue.

39:51.010 --> 39:52.280
I'll also go to the boy called Qi.

39:52.360 --> 39:52.840
You...

39:54.840 --> 39:56.490
Xianxian, I wanna pummel her.

39:56.600 --> 39:57.450
Okay, Shasha,

39:57.840 --> 39:58.930
you go back to the classroom.

39:59.250 --> 40:00.250
I'll have a talk with her.

40:00.450 --> 40:02.040
Don't promise her anything.

40:02.490 --> 40:03.490
I don't like her.

40:12.970 --> 40:13.690
Keke

40:15.120 --> 40:16.560
Let's have a talk.

40:23.840 --> 40:24.650
Okay.

40:24.840 --> 40:26.280
There are only us. What do you want to say?

40:33.890 --> 40:35.250
Sorry, Keke.

40:36.760 --> 40:38.080
Why do you apologize?

40:39.040 --> 40:40.170
For what?

40:46.520 --> 40:47.280
Come on.

40:47.930 --> 40:48.930
Actually,

40:49.080 --> 40:50.690
I should apologize to you.

40:51.490 --> 40:52.360
At the beginning,

40:52.450 --> 40:54.840
I made use of you to approach Zhou Siyue.

40:55.360 --> 40:56.600
Because I

40:56.970 --> 40:58.600
don't like being with girls,

40:58.930 --> 41:00.760
I always make friends with boys.

41:01.210 --> 41:02.450
But I found that

41:03.600 --> 41:04.800
you were more interesting than them.

41:06.250 --> 41:08.040
And this time I found

41:08.650 --> 41:09.890
Zhou Siyue

41:09.930 --> 41:11.800
had a special charm,

41:12.800 --> 41:13.560
but I don't like to

41:13.560 --> 41:15.490
make friends with one boring like him.

41:18.930 --> 41:20.560
He's an interesting man,

41:21.080 --> 41:22.560
not as boring as you said.

41:22.760 --> 41:23.650
Don't mind.

41:24.490 --> 41:26.250
I may prefer boys like Song Ziqi

41:26.250 --> 41:27.730
who is more outgoing.

41:27.840 --> 41:28.690
No, you can't.

41:28.840 --> 41:30.010
You can't approach him.

41:30.690 --> 41:32.320
I've promised not to pester Zhou Siyue

41:32.970 --> 41:34.730
but I didn't make any promise about Song Ziqi.

41:36.010 --> 41:36.970
Please,

41:37.250 --> 41:39.320
you'll provoke Shadi.

41:40.890 --> 41:41.760
Okay,

41:42.040 --> 41:43.010
take it easy.

41:46.690 --> 41:48.730
You'll look better with bangs.

41:49.650 --> 41:51.600
Shadi once said the same words.

41:53.930 --> 41:54.650
Really?

41:57.360 --> 41:58.210
I think

41:58.410 --> 42:00.080
you two can be good friends.

42:02.210 --> 42:03.410
Okay, I should have my lesson.

42:25.450 --> 42:27.210
What's going on with that You Keke?

42:28.280 --> 42:29.890
She's my friend.

42:31.560 --> 42:33.360
A letter makes you be friends?

42:35.690 --> 42:37.410
It's complex.

42:37.560 --> 42:39.450
Hard to explain.

42:40.730 --> 42:41.840
I never found that

42:42.170 --> 42:44.560
you were keen on helping others build relationships.

42:46.010 --> 42:47.210
But listen,

42:47.730 --> 42:49.890
I'm not interested in You Keke.

42:50.560 --> 42:52.520
Don't play tricks.

42:59.650 --> 43:00.650
Why?

43:01.520 --> 43:03.410
You Keke is so popular.

43:05.120 --> 43:07.360
If I were keen to make friends with those who are popular,

43:07.690 --> 43:09.120
and there are many such people here,

43:09.760 --> 43:11.120
I would be as busy as a bee.

43:15.080 --> 43:16.250
Good point.

43:17.490 --> 43:19.170
It's my fault this time.

43:19.650 --> 43:20.650
I apologize.

43:21.560 --> 43:22.520
Sorry.

43:25.010 --> 43:26.360
I'm sorry.

43:27.890 --> 43:28.520
Nice.

43:29.250 --> 43:30.170
Better than before.
